  - RULE-SET,applications,DIRECT
  - RULE-SET,cncidr,DIRECT,no-resolve

  # 8. GFW-blocked + non-CN TLDs → proxy
  - RULE-SET,gfw,🚀 Proxy
  - RULE-SET,tld-not-cn,🚀 Proxy

  # 9. CN IPs → direct
  - GEOIP,CN,DIRECT

  # 10. Everything else
  - MATCH,🐟 Final
